  "description": "The RYOBI 18V ONE+ HP Brushless line of products is redefining power and performance. The RYOBI 18V ONE+ HP Brushless Multi-Tool (PBLMT50B) and its aggressive 3.6° oscillation angle provides up to 30% faster cutting speeds allowing you to work more efficiently and effectively. The adjustable speed dial which operates at up to 20,000 Oscillations per Minute (OPM) gives the ability to make cuts into drywall, metal, wood, plastic, composite, and many other materials, along with the ability to sand the finest details. The tool-free accessory release makes switching accessories quick and easy which means less downtime. A built-in LED light illuminates dark work areas for improved visibility. The slide-on power switch eliminates the need to continuously hold a trigger while working which provides less user fatigue over extended use. The 18V ONE+ HP Brushless Multi-Tool is compatible with most multi-tool accessories from other brands. Best of all, it is part of the RYOBI 18V ONE+ System of over 225 tools that all work on the same battery platform. This Brushless Multi-Tool is backed by the RYOBI 3-Year Manufacturer's Warranty and includes the PBLMT50 18V ONE+ HP Brushless Multi-Tool, a wood cutting blade, a segment saw blade, a sanding pad, 3 pieces of sample sandpaper, and an operator's manual. Battery and charger sold separately.",
